                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the ideal points earn rate?</h3>
                                        <p>3-5% back is standard. Above 5% erodes margin. Vary by SKU category to protect hero-SKU margins.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use Yotpo Loyalty or build custom?</h3>
                                        <p>Yotpo / LoyaltyLion for most brands under 500K members. Custom for larger, more complex, or when platform limits become blockers.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I integrate loyalty with in-store POS?</h3>
                                        <p>Real-time API sync between POS and loyalty engine. Requires POS support for external customer lookup. Modern POSes (Shopify POS, Lightspeed, Toast) support this cleanly.</p>
                                        <h3>What is coalition loyalty worth?</h3>
                                        <p>Coalition programs (Air Miles ME, Nectar, Flybuys) trade brand equity for reach. Fine for large chains; usually not right for early-stage D2C.</p>
